# Byte-stable checkouts on every platform. Digests are pinned against
# fixture bytes (fixtures/incidents manifest case/source SHA-256s) and
# against this tree's own files (include_bytes! identities in screening
# reports), so line endings must never vary with core.autocrlf or a
# platform's default checkout behaviour.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Genuinely binary assets: never normalize, never merge.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
